It's time to embark on a long adventure that will become your favorite pastime for dozens of hours to come. Today, you have a great opportunity to download this game and become a brave hero who must save the world from dangerous monsters, create a small kingdom, and simply become a legend. But first, you'll need to gradually advance your career, carrying out missions for ordinary citizens and destroying the weakest creatures. We suggest you don't waste too much time — heroic achievements won't happen on their own, so sharpen your sword and hit the road.

Battles in the game are turn-based, with you taking turns striking and using abilities. You can deftly dodge and block attacks, and strive to achieve success by any means necessary. Once victory is achieved, collect loot and head to the blacksmith, who will craft brand-new equipment for you. Then, you can explore new lands that will delight you with their beauty and allow you to face more powerful enemies. Although the game looks like a typical adventure, it has its own atmosphere and unique visuals. To experience it all for yourself, simply download Swords and Souls: Neverseen via torrent in Russian.

Game features
- a dynamic combat system will definitely not let you get bored;
- an abundance of mini-games significantly diversify the gameplay and allow you to acquire completely new skills;
- create your personal hero and don’t forget about his equipment;
- explore dozens of different worlds, each of which will delight you in its own way;
- manage your personal city and improve buildings;
- Get trophies, set records and simply enjoy every element of the game.

Repack features:
